        "title": "A Handle Could Hide Too Much Policy",
        "description": "One drag gesture could silently choose identity, ownership, permissions, synchronization, default surface, and persistence behavior.",
        "likelihood": "high",
        "impact": "high",
        "mitigation": "Make the port contract declare materialization mode and permissions; show a choice only when the declaration leaves the mode ambiguous.",
        "definitionKey": "idea-risk",
