    {
      "id": "bridge-port-materialization-reading-note",
      "type": "markdown",
      "label": "Interaction Boundary",
      "position": {"x": 780, "y": 650},
      "width": 500,
      "height": 300,
      "ports": [{"id": "root", "label": "root", "direction": "bidirectional", "dataType": "any", "angle": 210}],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "identity": {"graphId": "bridge-port-materialization"},
        "title": "Interaction Boundary",
        "markdown": "## Boundary rule\n\n- **Bridge:** grants access to a declared graph capability.\n- **Port:** advertises a capability at a graph boundary.\n- **Product node:** graph-owned content created through the bridge.\n- **Document node:** graph-owned content created through the product's document port.\n- **Semantic zoom:** applies to the two content nodes, not to the bridge or port interface."
      }
    },
